  "body": "## Summary\n- Add `/add-rubrics` and `agent/add-rubrics` routing for rubric proposal requests.\n- Add a focused rubric-editing prompt and a small workflow that keeps runtime code on the default branch, edits a separate `agent/rubrics` checkout, validates YAML, and opens a draft PR targeting `agent/rubrics`.\n- Update docs and tests for the simplified proposal-only behavior.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm --prefix .agent run build`\n- `GITHUB_OUTPUT=/tmp/sepo-test-output node --test .agent/dist/__tests__/triage.test.js .agent/dist/__tests__/envelope.test.js .agent/dist/__tests__/response.test.js .agent/dist/__tests__/rubrics.test.js .agent/dist/__tests__/onboarding-check-cli.test.js`\n- `node --test .agent/dist/__tests__/docs-validation.test.js`\n- `GITHUB_OUTPUT=/tmp/sepo-test-output node --test .agent/dist/__tests__/envelope.test.js .agent/dist/__tests__/triage.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n\nCloses #381\n",
